laimed Leeds/Cambridge credentials, Goldman Sachs work and Adobe acquisition claims that Guardian could not verify; no records were found by cited organizations. Guardian reports celebrity support videos from Steve Wozniak, Chuck Norris, Jim Norton and Lance Bass, with no suggestion celebrities knew the business model; memberships minimum $300, 0.5% daily and 300% over 600 days, referral commissions down 20 levels, later withdrawal problems and migration to HyperNation. Guardian reports masked 'Mr H' and 'Miss N' presented as HyperNation ambassadors, and a promoter called HyperVerse/HyperNation 'one big entity'; Lee denied involvement in HyperNation in a 2023 Zoom meeting. Label allegations and unresolved identity/celebrity knowledge carefully."}
